LIST

C Debugging. eg 'DEBU 1 10 1' activates debugging from events 1 to 10,
C every event.
C DEBU 1 10 1

C Subsystem control: 
C   =0: subsystem off. No geometry (default)
C   =1: Geometry 
C   =2: Geometry+Hits (some detectors do the analysis here, 
C                      this should be fixed)
C   =3: Geometry+Hits+Analysis/Histograms
BPIP 2
SSVD 2
DCHA 2
DIRC 2
EMCA 2
MUON 2
USER 0

C--BEGIN 
C--  differs from standard prod.ffr _only_ in this section
C--                dyaeb 20000410
C Subsystem saving of interaction products
C   =0 throw 'em except for decays and muons + gustep exceptions
C   =1 keep 'em except for low energy electrons & neutrinos
C  defaults are 0 except for relevant PEP, SVT & DCH 
XDRC 1
XEMC 1
XIFR 1
C--END  differences from standard prod.ffr 

C HADR   Hadronic Interaction Control
C
C   HADR IHADR   
C           0 = no hadronic interactions
C (default) 1 = use GHEISHA for hadronic interactions
C           2 = same as 1 without generation of secondaries                
C           3 = use GHEISHA for hadrons above 5 GeV 
C               and NUCRIN/HADRIN for hadrons below 5 GeV                        
C           4 = use FLUKA
C           5 = use GCALOR                                        


C    gamma   elec  nhad  chad  mu    ebre   hbre   
CUTS 0.0001 0.0001 0.001 0.001 0.001 0.0001 0.0001 
C
C***************************
QAFLAG 2
QASAVE ' '
C***************************
STOP





